      "result": "{\"cards\":[{\"name\":\"Endurance\",\"rules\":[\"Flash\",\"Reach\",\"When {this} enters, up to one target player puts all the cards from their graveyard on the bottom of their library in a random order.\",\"Evoke\\u0026mdash;Exile a green card from your hand. \\u003ci\\u003e(You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it\\u0027s sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)\\u003c/i\\u003e\"]},{\"name\":\"Formidable Speaker\",\"rules\":[\"When {this} enters, you may discard a card. If you do, search your library for a creature card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\",\"{1}, {T}: Untap another target permanent.\"]},{\"name\":\"Wistfulness\",\"rules\":[\"When {this} enters, if {G}{G} was spent to cast it, exile target artifact or enchantment an opponent controls.\",\"When {this} enters, if {U}{U} was spent to cast it, draw two cards, then discard a card.\",\"Evoke {G/U}{G/U} \\u003ci\\u003e(You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it\\u0027s sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)\\u003c/i\\u003e\"]},{\"name\":\"Overlord of the Balemurk\",\"rules\":[\"Impending 5\\u0026mdash;{1}{B} \\u003ci\\u003e(If you cast this spell for its impending cost, it enters with five time counters and isn\\u0027t a creature until the last is removed. At the beginning of your end step, remove a time counter from it.)\\u003c/i\\u003e\",\"Whenever {this} enters or attacks, mill four cards, then you may return a non-Avatar creature card or a planeswalker card from your graveyard to your hand.\"]}],\"success\":true}",
