      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Pinnacle Emissary was cast for its Warp cost ({U/R}), meaning it would exile itself at the beginning of the next end step anyway and only be on the battlefield temporarily. Using Subtlety's evoke (which costs exiling Shardless Agent, one of the best cards in hand with cascade value) to bounce a creature that was going to leave play on its own is a very poor trade of resources - essentially 2 cards for a minimal tempo gain against a temporary threat.",
